Example path to put in the field
D:/hashcat/rules/best64.rule
Practical CTF workflow

First pass — wordlist only, no rules (fast)
If hashes remain — add best64.rule, run again
Still stuck — swap to dive.rule or OneRuleToRuleThemAll.rule
Last resort — brute force with Attack Mode 3 + mask

The ... browse button next to the field will let you navigate directly to your hashcat rules/ folder so you don't have to type the path manually.
